<section class="page-simple">
  <h1>About Us</h1>
  <p>Founded in 2015, the Diplomatic Club of Lusaka is a welcoming international community dedicated to bringing diplomats and their families together 
and helping them feel at home in Zambia.</p>
<p>We provide a platform for newly arrived diplomats to connect with fellow members, build friendships, integrate into the local community, and gain 
practical insights into life in Lusaka. Through social gatherings, cultural activities, shared experiences, and mutual support, we aim to make the 
transition to life in Zambia more enjoyable and fulfilling.</p>
<p>Beyond fostering friendship and connection, the Club also seeks to make a positive contribution to the wider Zambian community through charitable 
initiatives and fundraising events.</p>
<p>We warmly invite you to join us, build lasting connections, and become part of our international community in Lusaka.</p>
